; Caroline attacks while Darcy remains attentive.","notes":"","wordGoal":null},{"worldId":"pride-prejudice-world","createdAt":1785672000000,"updatedAt":1785672000000,"id":"pp-chapter-46","timelineId":"pp-timeline-main","number":46,"title":"Chapter 46","synopsis":"Jane’s letters announce Lydia’s elopement; Elizabeth tells Darcy and leaves.","notes":"","wordGoal":null},{"worldId":"pride-prejudice-world","createdAt":1785672000000,"updatedAt":1785672000000,"id":"pp-chapter-47","timelineId":"pp-timeline-main","number":47,"title":"Chapter 47","synopsis":"The Gardiners and Elizabeth hurry to a distressed Longbourn.","notes":"","wordGoal":null},{"worldId":"pride-prejudice-world","createdAt":1785672000000,"updatedAt":1785672000000,"id":"pp-chapter-48","timelineId":"pp-timeline-main","number":48,"title":"Chapter 48","synopsis":"The search exposes Wickham’s debts and produces no immediate result.","notes":"","wordGoal":null},{"worldId":"pride-prejudice-world","createdAt":1785672000000,"updatedAt":1785672000000,"id":"pp-chapter-49","timelineId":"pp-timeline-main","number":49,"title":"Chapter 49","synopsis":"Mr Gardiner reports that Lydia and Wickham have been found and can marry.","notes":"","wordGoal":null},{"worldId":"pride-prejudice-world","createdAt":1785672000000,"updatedAt":1785672000000,"id":"pp-chapter-50","timelineId":"pp-timeline-main","number":50,"title":"Chapter 50","synopsis":"The settlement provokes Mr Bennet’s shame and Mrs Bennet’s delight.","notes":"","wordGoal":null},{"worldId":"pride-prejudice-world","createdAt":1785672000000,"updatedAt":1785672000000,"id":"pp-chapter-51","timelineId":"pp-timeline-main","number":51,"title":"Chapter 51","synopsis":"The Wickhams visit; Lydia carelessly reveals Darcy’s presence at the wedding.","notes":"","wordGoal":null},{"worldId":"pride-prejudice-world","createdAt":1785672000000,"updatedAt":1785672000000,"id":"pp-chapter-52","timelineId":"pp-timeline-main","number":52,"title":"Chapter 52","synopsis":"Mrs Gardiner explains Dar